<title>FINLAND: FORECAST - FINNISH 1997 GDP GROWTH 5.7 PCT - PROTOS.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - FINNISH 1997 GDP GROWTH 5.7 PCT - PROTOS.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish gross domestic product growth will accelerate to 5.7 percent this year from 3.2 percent in 1996, brokerage Protos said in a report received on Monday, revising its 1997 growth forecast from 4.6 percent in November.</p>
<p>Protos saw 4.5 percent GDP growth in 1998.  </p>
<p>Key figures in Protos' April 1997 forecast:</p>
<p>				   1997	 1998    1996 actual</p>
<p> GDP			     +5.7	 +4.5	 +3.2</p>
<p> Exports			 +7.0	 +5.0	 +4.6</p>
<p> Imports			 +6.6	 +7.0	 +5.0</p>
<p> Private consumption	 +4.3	 +4.0	 +3.6</p>
<p> Public consumption	  +2.0	 +3.0	 +1.5</p>
<p> Private investment	 +14.0	+11.0	 +6.0  Public</p>
<p>investment	  +10.0	 +6.0	 +1.5</p>
<p> CPI			     +1.6	 +2.0	 +0.8</p>
<p> Unemployment		  13.7	 11.9	 15.5</p>
<p> C/A (FIM billion)	  +18.0	+20.0	+19.0</p>
<p>State debt</p>
<p> pct of GDP		    68.2	 65.0	 69.0</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
